,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yCqgQ9g4qKpY3Zi7C2ekwJZDqjB.jpg","released":"2024-05-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Superposición","overview":"Daniela sospecha que algo anda mal con su esposo. Jason y Amanda estrechan lazos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t38bXfIrb3rFEh6mNQidHSxD3Pf.jpg","released":"2024-06-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"En el fuego de las estrellas muertas","overview":"Jason y Amanda visitan un mundo increíble. Jason 2 toma una decisión desesperada para esconderle la verdad a Daniela.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2KHUbO3DrLjtoHzX2o1sbPm22yz.jpg","released":"2024-06-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Júpiter","overview":"Jason 2 entra en pánico y al encontrarse arrinconado le dice a Daniela y a Charlie que se vayan de la ciudad inmediatamente.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9t6UGyGDiQoQosJdgNxJekAz1WN.jpg","released":"2024-06-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"51 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Entrelazados","overview":"El mundo de los Dessen se viene abajo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wfLwlOHBy10TUE8WsebmlcFUx6a.jpg","released":"2024-06-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Una vida tranquila","overview":"Los Dessen tienen una visita no grata. Ryan encuentra a Amanda. Leighton se visita.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/GLRs8GT8vZfIXRJpg02rC1YFXB.jpg","released":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt19231492:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Un mundo perfecto","overview":"Reinicia la búsqueda por un nuevo hogar. Amanda y Ryan salen en una misión.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/znRs3CXoqKGEXua38SF9bAIrm57.jpg","released":"2026-09-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{